Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A tricky opening round for Zheng Qinwen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文的首轮打得并不轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}1{\fs68}号上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.96,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}中网女单首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.95,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}郑钦文对上施晗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:14.85,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}首盘两次先丢发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:16.94,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}又两次立刻追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:20.19,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}最惊险的一关 还在后面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:24.75,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}抢七{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 郑钦文握着{\fs78}4{\fs68}个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:27.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}施晗却一分一分往回追
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:30.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}看这一分 她从底线压到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:32.67,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}把压力重新推了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's long.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 出底线了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:45.31,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:48.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}个盘点全被施晗救回
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:50.97,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}郑钦文没有让首盘就此溜走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:53.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}接下来连拿两分 {\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.83,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第五个盘点 她终于兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:12.79,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘 前{\fs78}9{\fs68}局都没能破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:16.02,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}施晗在盘末 等来了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:18.69,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We are going the distance.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛要打满三盘了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:22.21,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}最后一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.21,0:01:25.39,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}看这次由底线追到网前的救球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:27.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}郑钦文拿下了这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:28.71,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}更关键的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.71,0:01:31.85,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她这盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}个发球局一共只丢三分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:34.41,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}没有让施晗拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:42.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Crucially.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N至关重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:46.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}个发球局只丢三分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:49.71,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}下一关卡林斯卡娅 这份稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:52.47,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}能带郑钦文再进一步吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:10.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A tricky opening round for Zheng Qinwen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文的首轮打得并不轻松
